## Valid results (only)

| Result | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| **PASS** | 100/100 |
| **OPTIMIZATION REQUIRED** | &lt; 100/100 — continue fix/optimize/re-audit |
| **WAITING FOR OWNER** | Owner action required |
| **EXTERNAL BLOCKER** | Credentials / provider / infra / external approval |
| **DENIED** | Owner does not approve |

**FAIL is never a final status** — only: root cause found → fix required → re-audit required.

## Order

Root cause → smallest fix → re-audit → optimization → re-audit → polish → re-audit → 100/100? → Component Freeze → next component.  
If cannot optimize → WAITING FOR OWNER or EXTERNAL BLOCKER.

